message: "If you use Atlas Physica in research or teaching, please cite the software using this metadata."
title: "Atlas Physica"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Tech Echo Collective"
version: "v3.0.5-alpha"
date-released: 2026-08-29
repository-code: "https://github.com/Tech-Echo-Collective/Physics-Atlas"
url: "https://atlas.techecho.org/"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Atlas Physica is an open scientific infrastructure prototype for exploring
  the geographic, temporal, and institutional structure of the global physics
  research ecosystem. Atlas Physica is developed and maintained by Tech Echo
  Collective. Previously named Physics Atlas; historical releases retain their
  original names and identifiers.
keywords:
  - physics
  - scientific infrastructure
  - research ecosystem
  - geographic visualization
  - open science
